* TOOL_AUDIT
* The audit trail on one screen: the newest lines first in view, filters, a go-to-date, a follow mode, the parts of the line under the cursor, and the lines shown saved to a record (S.75,
* plan .claude/plan-fullscreen-toolkit.md section 5, A5).
